---
import DetailLayout from '../layouts/DetailLayout.astro';
import MediaImage from '../components/MediaImage.astro';
import ImageGallery from '../components/ImageGallery.astro';
import VideoPlayer from '../components/VideoPlayer.astro';
import { media } from '../data/media';
---
<DetailLayout title="Outside the code" description="A little more about Austin: music and radio, football and basketball, films, friends and life beyond the screen." personal>
  <header class="personal-hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">A little more about me</p><h1>Outside<br />the code<span class="terracotta">.</span></h1><p class="personal-intro">There’s more to me<br />than what I build.</p><p>Music, sport, films and time with friends. Here’s a small collection of the things that fill the space around my work.</p><span class="personal-note">A few snapshots, a few good links.</span></div><div class="portrait-print"><MediaImage src={media.portrait} alt="Austin smiling in a light-coloured hoodie." eager /><span class="print-caption">Austin Bwanika🕺🏾</span></div></header>
  <nav class="personal-nav" aria-label="Outside the code interests"><a href="#music">01 / Music & radio</a><a href="#sport">02 / Football & basketball</a><a href="#films">03 / Films & series</a><a href="#life">04 / Life & friends</a></nav>
  <section id="music" class="personal-section"><div class="interest-heading"><p class="eyebrow">01 / Music & radio</p><h2>On the air.<br /><em>In the playlist.</em></h2></div><div class="interest-content"><p>Music is a big part of my life and my alter ego Kasetunes is a avenue for me to share and talk about my passion surrounding the music industry while curating different playlists according to different genres and topics. Every week I host "The Kasetunes Show" from 2-3pm as part of KCL Radio where I talk about everything music and current affairs in the world.</p><p>For a listen, there’s “The Good Old Days”, the second episode of the show. My playlists are available on both Apple Music and Spotify in the link below.</p><div class="project-links"><a class="text-link" href="https://www.mixcloud.com/ilovekclradio/the-kasetunes-show-episode-2-the-good-old-days/">Listen on Mixcloud ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="https://linktr.ee/Kasetunes">Explore my playlists ↗</a></div><MediaImage src={media.kasetunes} alt="The Kasetunes Show artwork with colourful cut-out lettering on a cream background." caption="The Kasetunes Show" /></div></section>
  <section id="sport" class="personal-section"><div class="interest-heading"><p class="eyebrow">02 / Football & basketball</p><h2>In the stands.<br /><em>On the court.</em></h2></div><div class="interest-content"><p>Football finds its way into both my projects and my time away from them. Basketball is part of that time too where I have captained my university’s recreational team as well as my high school Basketball team. </p><div class="sport-media"><MediaImage src={media.footballStadium} alt="Austin standing in stadium seating with a football pitch behind him." caption="A view from the World Cup game Ivory Coast vs Germany" /><VideoPlayer file="media/basketball.mp4" poster={media.basketball} title="On the basketball court · 27 seconds" description="A short clip of me playing basketball" portrait /></div><MediaImage src={media.footballMatch} alt="A football match viewed from the stands, with players on the pitch and spectators in front." caption="Brighton vs Fulham" /></div></section>
  <section id="films" class="personal-section film-section"><div class="interest-heading"><p class="eyebrow">03 / Films & series</p><h2>Something<br /><em>to watch.</em></h2></div><div class="interest-content"><div class="film-note"><span class="mini-label">Away from the editor</span><p>Films and series are another part of life outside the code. You can find me on Letterboxd.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://boxd.it/hbIAD">Find me on Letterboxd ↗</a><span class="film-strip" aria-hidden="true">◻ ◻ ◻ ◻ ◻ ◻ ◻ ◻</span></div></div></section>
  <section id="life" class="personal-section"><div class="interest-heading"><p class="eyebrow">04 / Life, friends & experiences</p><h2>The moments<br /><em>in between.</em></h2><p>Graduation, time with friends and a few photographs away from a screen.</p></div><div class="interest-content"><ImageGallery images={[{src:media.graduation,alt:'Austin in graduation robes beside a pond.',caption:'Graduation'},{src:media.friendsDinner,alt:'A group of people sitting around a restaurant table with food and drinks.',caption:'Dinner with my high school friends'},{src:media.graduationCeremony,alt:'A graduation ceremony inside a large hall.',caption:'A moment from the ceremony'},{src:media.friendsTogether,alt:'Three people seated together in a restaurant booth.',caption:'Meeting up with my cousins'}]} /></div></section>
  <div class="personal-ending"><span aria-hidden="true">✳</span><p>Thanks for getting to know<br /><em>a little more of me.</em></p></div>
</DetailLayout>
